    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "\"Lucy-May of the Southern Rainbow\" is a Japanese anime series by Nippon Animation and is based on \"Southern Rainbow\" by Australian writer Phyllis Piddington (1910–2001), and tells the story of a young girl named Lucy and the hardships and excitement she and her family encounter when they move from England to Adelaide in Australia to start a farm.",
